      "id": "SpearPillar_Text_SurprisedYouMadeIt",
      "en_US": [
        "Mars: I’m surprised you made it\n",
        "here. You can stay if you won’t\r",
        "meddle."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SpearPillar_Text_BeQuietAndWatch",
      "en_US": [
        "Jupiter: Be quiet and watch what\n",
        "our boss is about to do."
      ]
